{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_053_ko_053_0010_0010", "id": null, "offset": 40, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "王城小[山]名.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_053_ko_053_0010_0010", "id": null, "offset": 114, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "雞貴者, 梵云, 矩矩吒㗨〔醫〕說羅, 矩矩吒是雞, 㗨說羅是貴, 則高麗國也, 相傳云, 彼國敬雞神而取尊, 故戴翎羽而表飾矣. 那爛陀有池, 名曰龍泉, 西方喚高麗, 爲矩矩吒㗨說羅也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_053_ko_053_0010_0040", "id": null, "offset": 32, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "唐云一切智天.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_053_ko_053_0010_0070", "id": null, "offset": 29, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "唐云慧甲.", "type": "원주"}
